# CONFLICT HANDLING

When sources present conflicting information:

1. **Quantitative Differences**: Present as range
   - "Reported rates range from X% to Y% <cite source="A"/><cite source="B"/>"

2. **Contradictory Claims**: Present both perspectives
   - "While [Author A] reports...<cite source="A"/>, [Author B] found...<cite source="B"/>"

3. **Methodological Differences**: Acknowledge study design
   - "In a retrospective series...<cite source="A"/> compared to prospective data...<cite source="B"/>"

