# SUBSECTION GENERATION

When section exceeds 800 words, consider logical subsections:

**Automatic Subsection Triggers**:
- Anatomy sections → by layer or region
- Surgical sections → by phase (Exposure, Intradural, Closure)
- Epidemiology → by demographic or geographic factors
- Treatment → by modality (Medical, Surgical, Radiation)
- Outcomes → by outcome type (Survival, Functional, Complications)

**Subsection Format**:
```markdown
### [Subsection Title]

[Content for this subsection]
```
